        "created_at": "2018-08-17T13:37:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>This was ruled on by Christopher during playtesting that Primordial Seeds played from an Environment Deck go to Akash’Thriya’s play area. Unless a card specifies otherwise they go to the play area of the deck it belongs to.</span></p>",
